    "traits": "Consumable Herb",
    "description": "<strong>Usage held in 1 hand; Activate Interact (2 AP).</strong>\n\nTerrain: any ruins or abandoned settlements.\n\nQuietroot is a dark, knotted bulb most often found beneath the collapsed thresholds of abandoned buildings. It makes no sound when cut, crushed or dropped, and folklore claims that it grows wherever a household's last words went unheard. Mixed with wax and fine ash, it becomes a dull salve rubbed across boots, buckles and other loose equipment. For 10 minutes, you gain a +2-item bonus to Stealth checks where the sound you make is relevant.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 6.",
